        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Letter from Daniel J. Edelman, Inc. — April 6, 1995</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 8.5in;\n    min-height: 11in;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0.75in 0.85in 0.4in 0.9in;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  /* ---- Header zone: address block left, logo right ---- */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .letterhead {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11.5pt;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n  .letterhead .company {\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.6px;\n  }\n  .logo-block {\n    text-align: right;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    margin-right: 20px;\n  }\n  .logo-tag {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11pt;\n    margin-bottom: -6px;\n    padding-right: 4px;\n  }\n  .logo-word {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 46pt;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n  .logo-word .cap {\n    font-size: 62pt;\n  }\n  /* ---- Body ---- */\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 14.5pt;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 58px;\n  }\n  .date { margin-bottom: 34px; }\n  .recipient { margin-bottom: 32px; }\n  .salutation { margin-bottom: 28px; }\n  .body-text p {\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  ul.bullets {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 30px 0 30px 0;\n    padding: 0 0 0 0.85in;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 0.72in;\n    margin-bottom: 26px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  ul.bullets li::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0.36em;\n    width: 0.13in;\n    height: 0.13in;\n    background: #000;\n  }\n  .closing { margin-top: 34px; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: none;\n    color: #555;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 8pt;\n  }\n  .signature.placeholder {\n    width: 3in;\n    height: 0.95in;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .stamp.placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6.55in;\n    left: 4.55in;\n    width: 1.85in;\n    height: 1.75in;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  /* ---- Footer ---- */\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 1.15in;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 11.5pt;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n  }\n  .recycle.placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0.35in;\n    bottom: 0.35in;\n    width: 0.4in;\n    height: 0.4in;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"letterhead\">\n      <div class=\"company\">DANIEL&nbsp; J.&nbsp; EDELMAN, INC.</div>\n      1420 K Street, N.W.<br>\n      10th Floor<br>\n      Washington, D.C. 20005<br>\n      Phone 202. 371-0200<br>\n      FAX 202. 371-0490<br>\n      FAX 202. 371-2858<br>\n      Telex 6501454152 MCI\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"logo-block\">\n      <div class=\"logo-tag\">Public Relations Worldwide</div>\n      <div class=\"logo-word\"><span class=\"cap\">E</span>DELMAN</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"body-text\">\n    <div class=\"date\">April 6, 1995</div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipient\">\n      Mr. Dave Ahearn<br>\n      Economic Correspondent<br>\n      Bloomberg Business News<br>\n      292 National Press Building<br>\n      Washington, DC&nbsp; 20045\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"salutation\">Dear Mr. Ahearn:</div>\n\n    <p>As you know, negotiations are getting underway for Chile to join the North American Free Trade Agreement.&nbsp; President Clinton and the other Nafta nations made the invitation last December.</p>\n\n    <p>Edelman is handling Chile&rsquo;s communications activities in the United States, and I want to let you know that we can be of assistance when you prepare stories on the upcoming negotiations.&nbsp; We can provide you with a broad range of information on Chile such as media kits and interview opportunities with Chilean officials.</p>\n\n    <p>It is important to keep in mind why the Nafta nations selected Chile as their first Latin American partner:</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"bullets\">\n      <li>Chile&rsquo;s economy has undergone dramatic reform and is one of the most open and advanced in Latin America;</li>\n      <li>Chile can serve as a key building block in expanding economic reforms and more open trade throughout the hemisphere;</li>\n      <li>Chile is a proven investment partner for the U.S.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>Please feel free to contact me if I can be of any assistance.&nbsp; My phone number is 202-371-0200.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"closing\">\n      Sincerely,\n      <figure class=\"signature placeholder\" style=\"margin-left:0;\">[Signature: handwritten, below closing]</figure>\n      Jeffrey M. Surrell\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"stamp placeholder\">[Stamp: rotated 90&deg;, faint &mdash; &ldquo;RECEIVED JUN 29 [?] 95 &middot; DEPT. JUSTICE &middot; CRIMINAL DIVISION &middot; [illegible] SECTION&rdquo;, centered over bullet list]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    Atlanta&nbsp; Chicago&nbsp; Dallas&nbsp; Houston&nbsp; Los Angeles&nbsp; Louisville&nbsp; New York&nbsp; Sacramento&nbsp; San Francisco&nbsp; Silicon Valley&nbsp; Washington<br>\n    Argentina&nbsp; Beijing&nbsp; Brussels&nbsp; Dublin&nbsp; Frankfurt&nbsp; Guangzhou&nbsp; Hong Kong&nbsp; Kuala Lumpur&nbsp; London&nbsp; Madrid&nbsp; Melbourne<br>\n    Mexico City&nbsp; Milan&nbsp; Montreal&nbsp; Paris&nbsp; Shanghai&nbsp; Singapore&nbsp; Sydney&nbsp; Tokyo&nbsp; Toronto\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"recycle placeholder\">[Logo: recycling symbol, bottom-right]</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
